.TH SIGALTSTACK 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sigaltstack \- changes or queries the alternate signal stack using the linux x86-64 kernel stack_t layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <signal.h>
.B int sigaltstack(const stack_t* stack, stack_t* previous);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes or queries the alternate signal stack using the Linux x86-64 kernel stack_t layout.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigaltstack (2)
